================================================================================
Third-party data
================================================================================

Market data is fetched at runtime from Yahoo Finance (via yfinance) and Stooq.
No vendor market data is committed to this repository. Use of those sources is
governed by each provider's own terms of service; see the "Data sources" section
of README.md.

